{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35649","headline":"酬刘书记一二知己见寄 · 李山甫","name":"酬刘书记一二知己见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"见说金台客，相逢秪论诗。\n坐来残暑退，吟许野僧知。\n自喜幽栖僻，唯慙道义亏。\n身闲偏好古，句冷不求奇。\n晦迹全无累，安贫自得宜。\n同人终念我，莲社有归期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李山甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35649.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35649","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}